Q5) catch block

**********************catch handles the exception.

try {
    int result = 10 / 0;
}
catch (ArithmeticException e) {
    System.out.println("Cannot divide by zero");
}

**************************Output:
Cannot divide by zero

************************************Interview answer
The catch block is used to handle an exception thrown from the corresponding try block.

