Q6) finally ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

*************************finally is used for cleanup code.
Example:
try {
    System.out.println("Try");
}
catch (Exception e) {
    System.out.println("Catch");
}
finally {
    System.out.println("Finally");

***********************Output:
Try
Finally

*******************Common use:
Close file
Close database connection
Release resources

***********Interview answer
The finally block is generally used to execute cleanup code. It normally executes whether an exception occurs or not.

