Q8) Can we have try without catch?

YES, if finally is present.
**********************

try {
    System.out.println("Hello");
}
finally {
    System.out.println("Finally");
}

*************************But this is invalid:
try {                                       //A try block must have at least: catch OR finally
    System.out.println("Hello");               ❌ Compile-time error.
}

